The allegations in the complaint are to the following effect;
On 15.02.2020, at about 01:15 am, the Food Safety Officer, Angamaly Circle Vigilance Squad reached the premises 2025:KER:65144 of M/s.Moolans Exports (India) Pvt. Ltd., Angamaly,
Ernakulam, in which the 1st petitioner is working as the Food Business Operator and the Sqaud purchased 2 kg of 'coriander whole' kept for sale along with other food articles for the purpose of analysis by issuing Form VA notice to the 1 st petitioner.
